	(text_box "Power status of each USB Port can be determined by directly sensing the VBUS of J1 and J101 through resistor voltage dividers into 3V3 domain. Avoids Back feeding risks, eliminates need for open-collector pull up handling, provides clear indication of which USB port is supplying power "
